  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-10-03T14:49:47.710Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "After being on VRChat for 30-60 minutes, my friends list goes out of sync. All statuses including online/offline statuses stop updating. I no longer receive any invites or friend requests, and when I send invites they do not go through. \n\nI confirm I am receiving them via VRCX but I still cannot join through that app either. \n\nThe only fix is to close and restart VRChat. I have already tried disabling IPV6 and the issue happens sooner than it does with IPV6 enabled.\n\nThis is happening to many people I have spoken to, and has been ongoing even before the 2022 beta. Regardless of using regualr or beta, the issue persists and happens every time I play.",
